dation run mutates it and RUN2 must say so rather than discover it afterwards. TWO NUMBERS R2 NEEDS AND DID NOT HAVE: 34 seconds per tick, so about 11 minutes for 20 ticks; and three files written per tick -- the trace record, the run receipt, and the lane futility index."
