         :b "No experiment on a recorded field distinguishes the arms, because the record that would be the experiment ALREADY EXISTS and is what raised the question. Running more S4 ticks produces more records of the same kind; every one of them is simultaneously the evidence field's discharge and the falsifier field's refutation. A flag-on/flag-off comparison separates the machine's two behaviours, which is not in dispute, and not the two readings of the declaration."
