  :evidence "DONE-UNREVIEWED. futon2 20381c6c (generator + regenerated registry) + 187c2af3 (the ledger and a docstring-pointer fix) + p4ng e1ac30e (five consumers, controls, paper). THE SCALE IS DERIVED, NEVER ASSERTED, and every rung prints the pointer that licenses it: scripts/generate_variable_situation_accounting.bb attaches :rung, :rung-ladder and :rung-blocked-by to all 133 rows. Rungs 0-3 are machine-derived and nothing above them is -- `named` from the contract manifest literal in Holes.lean, `type-transcribed` from a Lean definition site for a CLOSED declaration (a HOLE stays at named and says so: its proposition is stated, not discharged), `formula-transcribed` from a passing checks/witness-registry.edn entry, and `witnessed` only if that entry's evidence artifact carries a run identity. LADDER TODAY: 19 named / 62 type-transcribed / 52 formula-transcribed / 0 witnessed / 0 above. THE HEADLINE NUMBER IS THE ZERO AND IT IS DERIVED: all 43 witness-registry entries carry a :fixture, 41 of them hand-derived reference artifacts (holes/labs/wm-contract/act-gate-reference.edn:5 declares itself :kind :hand-derived-from-record), and the only two whose fixture IS a machine record (wmRunsOnce and wmRunConformsToWiring, both on tick-run-record-2026-08-30.edn) are contract HOLES, so they stand at named anyway. Nothing in the model is licensed by a record exhibiting the quantity. THE SCORES BUCKET READS AS THE GREENFIELD IT IS, which is the fork TRACE-box2-scores-accounting.md:44 left open: the 15 declarations that printed 0 holes now print 5 type-transcribed, 10 formula-transcribed, 0 witnessed, 0 constructed (sec-model-coverage-generated.tex row 2: `0 & 5 & 10 & 0`), pinned by negative_controls.sh 11n so a silent move fails rather than being re-read by a human. THE FIXTURE REFUSAL, the conventions note's aspirational checker made real (N-process-trap-recording-conventions.md:335): a DECLARED rung at :constructed or above whose licence carries no run identity is refused, :error :fixture-at-constructed. IT IS A WHITELIST, NOT A FIXTURE BLACKLIST, and the reason is recorded rather than glossed: checks/witness-registry.edn files a real tick record under :fixture, so a path blacklist would refuse the one true record in the registry and admit every reference fixture a later commit renames. The declared-rung map is EMPTY -- no row has been shown to reach a rung the derivation cannot license, and seeding it would be writing a ruling. A CHECKER WITH NO POPULATION CANNOT BE TOLD FROM A NO-OP, so --negative-rung plants the population: (a) off-scale rung, (b) no :licence, (c) unresolvable licence, (d) a rung that SKIPS the one below it, (e) FIXTURE AT :constructed, (f) a declaration that retracts rather than licenses -- each refused with its own :error key -- plus two acceptances, a record-licensed :witnessed+:constructed pair and the unchanged derived floor under an empty map. THE WORD \"closed\" LEFT THE REGISTRY: :closed-by-record-negative-space -> :record-negative-space and :closed-by-record-with-witness -> :record-with-witness; :proven-against-pinned-source never carried it. CONSUMERS, all five re-run: gen_model_coverage.py's closed/open columns became four rung bands read from the registry's OWN :rung axis (a rung the generator has no band for stops the build, the 8b lesson); gen_variable_situation_table.bb gained the stage table with every rung printed INCLUDING the five empty ones, because a scale rendered only down to where the evidence stops reads as a completed ladder; gen_rnode_dossiers.py consumes the per-declaration rungs with the accounting's own licences and REFUSES an accounting whose :rung axis is not its SCALE -- the ruling's lane-independence is a claim two generators can falsify by drifting apart, so it is checked; gen_war_room_tetrahedron.bb took the de-closured vocabulary; sec-case-study-vetting.tex's tabular and caption were relabelled, with no number restated in prose. A DIVERGENCE RECORDED AND NOT RESOLVED: N-process-trap-recording-conventions.md:231 carries a NINTH rung, RECORDED, between `constructed` and `wired`. This row's :statement gives the ruling's verbatim eight, and gen_rnode_dossiers.py:71 already renders those eight, so the eight are implemented and the disagreement is written into the generator at the scale definition. WHICH SCALE IS THE SCALE IS A RULING AND IS NOT MADE HERE. LEDGER CONSEQUENCE, stated because it is a supersession: :U20 signed [:rows {:name \"No self-certification\"}] in this registry at 0880e24, and every row gained :rung fields, so that signature had come to describe a state it never saw. Repaired the way TN 9a prescribes and the way :U20 itself repaired :U14 -- :U20 keeps its signature untouched and gains :superseded-by :F6, and this row drops :covers-key :none (false the moment the registry moved) for the same :covers-key plus :registry-path. THE COST IS THE SAME COST :U20 RECORDED: supersession is whole-row, so the automated check on that one entry now rests on a reviewer signature here. GATES, bare exits: generate_variable_situation_accounting.bb --negative-rung, --negative-untyped, --negative-drift and --negative-empty all PASS; clj-kondo 0 errors / 0 warnings on the generator and on gen_variable_situation_table.bb, linted per file; futon4/dev/check-parens.sh OK on both plus worklist.edn and variable-situation-accounting.edn; negative_controls.sh PASS 75 negative / 43 positive (was 69/40); pointer_check.bb 1466 pointers / 0 unresolved; check_tex_reachability.py PASS with its three negative controls; worklist_check.bb exit 0. PAPER REBUILT WITHOUT THE FORBIDDEN STEP: gen_aif_dag.bb was NOT run (TN 9a), so build-p4ng.sh was not run end to end; its two build stages were run directly. PDF via latexmk on the /usr/local/texlive/2026 tree: 61 pages, 0 LaTeX errors, 0 undefined references, 0 missing citations -- unchanged from a baseline build of the pre-change tree, which also gives 61 pages. HTML via futon5 build-site-oxide.sh: rc 0, 0 ltx_ERROR spans, the publish gate's own measure. NOT REPAIRED, MEASURED: the new table adds 2 overfull hboxes (8.9pt and 24.1pt, both in the R6 dossier's declaration-readiness line), down from 197pt by adding break points after the pointer separators; the tree carried 45 before and carries 47 now, and no gate measures overfull boxes. PRE-EXISTING AND NOT MINE, checked against a baseline build: the 2 \"Misplaced \\noalign\" warnings at sec-case-study-vetting.tex and the 1 clj-kondo format-string error in gen_war_room_tetrahedron.bb:195 are present with my changes stashed. NOT DONE, STATED: NO RULING -- aif-equations.edn :choices and control-map-edges.edn :decisions untouched, and the declared-rung map is empty rather than seeded. The rungs above `witnessed` have no derivation and the generator says so in its own text. No src/ change in futon2, so no test run is claimed; no tick, no run lock, nothing under data/. The 17-row unbucketed hole list of the F4 amendment is not built here."}
